{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your path to a high score with your own strategy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Pile is a creative block-building, strategy-driven roguelite where you manage a floating island in the sky. Stack, place, and combine various types of blocks to trigger chain reactions, accumulate points, and complete construction goals in each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/f77fe4e5af3e1b8eb97437bf538d757e.poster.avif?t=1767794780\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/f77fe4e5af3e1b8eb97437bf538d757e.webm?t=1767794780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/f77fe4e5af3e1b8eb97437bf538d757e.mp4?t=1767794780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead and place each block with purpose\u2014every drop can become the start of a massive score chain. Different blocks come with unique effects, and clever combinations can lead to explosive point gains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of block types to choose from, offering countless build variations. As you progress, construction goals become more challenging, but rarer and more powerful blocks will also appear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of item types are available, allowing for endless combinations. As your build deepens, score targets continue to rise, and through item synergy, you gain the power to take on even greater challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to master. While the controls are simple, building a stable and efficient structure requires careful planning and thoughtful decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round ends when your blocks run out. Make the most of limited resources, build higher, score bigger, and survive the ever-shifting construction loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new block resources to expand your island. Every choice you make shapes your final structure\u2014and determines your maximum score.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Clear Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3855840/e77bb95d99f01cf7b2198bb58fcaaeeda747b724.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3855840/b58fa99a4e4d567892db7a640c43f2189f65db94.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3855840/308e3779c3dc72d5d0bc59fac67b8046f9d0e2d5.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Level 7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3855840/1349d6fa1db122c30eece91e49978f5ea5ec671c.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Level 8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3855840/36d248e05253abd2c8dbfab634627bd888e53a76.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Level 9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3855840/662ca6dbb4f8ec0bd38fb7957db914001ea126b0.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Level 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3855840/8fca8489dd8b6a6d5bf1c0aedec058678123cde5.jpg"},{"name":"Place 50 Blocks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3855840/0eba5fe4b68b8fdd8a6147d62f0c51bed02d6fdc.jpg"},{"name":"Place 100 Blocks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3855840/90ff168c329a7e1f22c382155caee5a2016562f2.jpg"},{"name":"Place 300 Blocks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3855840/80ebc8a121a7df55d40d4b176bd92d6764c442b7.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855840?t=1767794780","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/a96cc2d3b8c9ec6e60192b5d84c06d4489124515/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767794780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/d1f7e8c125cacfb995adb8a2a6b6dc9d88de914b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767794780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/d1f7e8c125cacfb995adb8a2a6b6dc9d88de914b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767794780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3909460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your path to a high score with your own strategy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Pile is a creative block-building, strategy-driven roguelite where you manage a floating island in the sky. Stack, place, and combine various types of blocks to trigger chain reactions, accumulate points, and complete construction goals in each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/f77fe4e5af3e1b8eb97437bf538d757e.poster.avif?t=1767794780\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/f77fe4e5af3e1b8eb97437bf538d757e.webm?t=1767794780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/f77fe4e5af3e1b8eb97437bf538d757e.mp4?t=1767794780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead and place each block with purpose\u2014every drop can become the start of a massive score chain. Different blocks come with unique effects, and clever combinations can lead to explosive point gains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of block types to choose from, offering countless build variations. As you progress, construction goals become more challenging, but rarer and more powerful blocks will also appear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of item types are available, allowing for endless combinations. As your build deepens, score targets continue to rise, and through item synergy, you gain the power to take on even greater challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to master. While the controls are simple, building a stable and efficient structure requires careful planning and thoughtful decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round ends when your blocks run out. Make the most of limited resources, build higher, score bigger, and survive the ever-shifting construction loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new block resources to expand your island. Every choice you make shapes your final structure\u2014and determines your maximum score.</p></li></ul>","developers":["RoeBox"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/e45734aad517b0c9be3ca3e7b21b09ce8560c6cf/header.jpg?t=1767794780","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic